    "body": "## Summary\n- Fixes marmot-protocol/marmot-security#2.\n- Deduplicates fresh-wrapper replays by stable inner message identity/content hash instead of only the outer wrapper event id.\n- Adds storage lookup support and regression coverage for application and commit replay paths.\n\n## Verification\n- cargo test -p mdk-core replayed_ --lib\n- cargo test -p mdk-core --test storage_traits_memory test_processed_message\n- cargo test -p mdk-core --test storage_traits_sqlite test_processed_message\n- cargo check --workspace\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://stagereview.app/marmot-protocol/mdk/pull/316\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-dark.svg\">\n    <img src=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-light.svg\" alt=\"Open in Stage\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-end -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/marmot-protocol/mdk/pull/316?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
